    "detailed_description": "No ads, no timers, just a stress-free puzzle experience. I hope you enjoy this simple Match 3 game I've built for my Steam debut.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shift Rows or Columns, not Symbols</h2>  In RC Match 3, you shift an entire row or column of symbols at a time. This makes for a slightly different puzzle than others in the genre, as the symbols are constantly shifting around the board.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increasing Difficulty</h2>  As your score increases, more symbols will be added to the mix, making it more likely you'll reach a Game Over state. Can you learn to use the shifting rows to your advantage and set up future moves? The game tracks your personal high score so you can see how far you've come. How high can you go?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Theme!</h2>  Choose from 4 themes, including one featuring a colorblind-friendly palette.",
    "about_the_game": "No ads, no timers, just a stress-free puzzle experience. I hope you enjoy this simple Match 3 game I've built for my Steam debut.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shift Rows or Columns, not Symbols</h2>  In RC Match 3, you shift an entire row or column of symbols at a time. This makes for a slightly different puzzle than others in the genre, as the symbols are constantly shifting around the board.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increasing Difficulty</h2>  As your score increases, more symbols will be added to the mix, making it more likely you'll reach a Game Over state. Can you learn to use the shifting rows to your advantage and set up future moves? The game tracks your personal high score so you can see how far you've come. How high can you go?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Theme!</h2>  Choose from 4 themes, including one featuring a colorblind-friendly palette.",
    "short_description": "Shift entire Rows or Columns to match symbols in this colorful, low-stress Match 3 game. Use the shifting board to your advantage to build your personal high score. Customize your theme with different backgrounds, symbols, and colors. Relax and enjoy a streamlined, ad-free puzzle experience.",
